  "_README": "Curated registry of the LATEST labour-force period each National Statistical Office (NSO) has PUBLISHED. The pipeline compares this against ILOSTAT's latest period and lists everything in between as 'pending in ILOSTAT'. Only countries listed here get a pending badge; everything else shows 'not tracked'. Keys are ISO3 codes. Add as many as you like.",
  "_schema": {
    "nso": "Name/abbrev of the statistics office (shown in the UI)",
